# Made up: a pnpm workspace upgrades React in two apps and adds zod to one (one root lockfile), a Go
# service bumps a module with its go.sum, a Ruby tool's lockfile moves on its own, a Rust crate bumps
# serde without its Cargo.lock, a workspace package edits only a script, .nvmrc moves to Node 22, and
# a small code edit.
=== file .nvmrc
20
